# Multi-threaded Transport Management System in C#

Below is a complete implementation of a Transport Management System with three decoupled modules in C#. The system uses asynchronous programming and threading to handle real-time data processing.

## System Architecture Overview

```
┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                 Transport Management System           │
├───────────────┬───────────────────────┬───────────────┤
│ Fleet Tracker │ Route Optimization   │ Billing System │
│ (Module 1)    │ (Module 2)           │ (Module 3)    │
└───────────────┴───────────────────────┴───────────────┘
```

## Implementation

### 1. Shared Data Models (Shared between modules)

```csharp
// Shared/TelemetryData.cs
public class TelemetryData
{
